  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sankar Kumar vs State Of Odisha .... Opposite Party on 5 January, 2024 Author: Sashikanta Mishra Bench: Sashikanta Mishra In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Ablapl No. 13774 of 2023 Sankar Kumar .... Petitioner Dakua Mr. B.P. Das, Advocate -Versus - State of Odisha .... Opposite Party Additional Standing Counsel Coram: Justice Sashikanta Mishra Order_ 05.01.2024 Order No. 1. This matter is taken up through hybrid mode.",
    "facts": "The petitioner is apprehending arrest in connection with Machhakund P.S. No. 142 of 2023 corresponding to G.R. Case No.100 of 2023 pending in the court of learned J.M.F.C., Lamtaput for the alleged commission of offence under Sections 272/273/420/34 of IPC and Sections 51/52/57/56/59 of Food Safety & Standards Act. 4. Learned State Counsel requests for further time to obtain chemical examination report, which this Court is not inclined to grant. 5. It is alleged that the petitioner and several other persons were manufacturing pan masala illegally. It is submitted that the co-accused persons have been released on bail.",
